  "summary": {
    "text": "Command A Translate is Cohere's first machine translation model, a 111B-parameter model in the Command A family for translation between 23 languages. It was released on 28 August 2025 on the Cohere API, with open weights for non-commercial research use, and Cohere stresses private hosting behind a company's own firewall for sensitive documents.",
