  "notes": "Cohere calls it its first machine translation model. Not listed on the deprecations page as of 2026-10-01. Cohere also offers Deep Translation, an agentic multi-step refinement on request; that is a service, not a separate model. A WMT 2025 paper (ACL Anthology, https://aclanthology.org/2025.wmt-1.55/) is cited from the model card and not registered as a source. The Hugging Face repository was created on 2025-08-27."
